{"unit_id":"A7m0spHere__dsh-feiyuFM#readme-13","repo":"A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM","commit":"b96887cb32d4b35b7ecc3ceb6d85c9fb999e5481","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feiyufm README · 数据与开发：曲库、偏好、反馈、收听历史和用量账本保存在本机，默认位于 `$DSH_HOME/fishfm/music.sqlite`。网易云会话由 Windows DPAPI 或 macOS Keychain 保存，数据库只保存凭据引用。模型接收有界的音乐事实，不接收 Cookie 或凭据；歌词仅用于显示，不进入模型输入。详见 [架构](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) 和 [控制契约](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/blob/main/docs/CORE_CONTRACT.md)。","source":"extracted","section":"数据与开发"}
{"unit_id":"A7m0spHere__dsh-feiyuFM#readme-14","repo":"A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM","commit":"b96887cb32d4b35b7ecc3ceb6d85c9fb999e5481","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feiyufm README · 数据与开发：[参与开发与源码安装](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) · [文档索引](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/blob/main/docs/README.md) · [反馈问题](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/issues)\n\n鲸鱼娘（大肥鱼）形象由 **@ZipZipPipe** 基于 **上善无形** 的原创角色进行二次设计。来源与完整版权说明见 [版权声明](https://github.com/A7m0spHere/dsh-feiyuFM/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)。","source":"extracted","section":"数据与开发"}
